flowchart LR
  subgraph CH[Sales channels]
    WEB[Website webhook]
    NY[Nykaa webhook]
    FK[Flipkart poller<br/>every 2 min]
    BL[Blinkit webhook + daily CSV]
  end

  WEB --> AD
  NY --> AD
  FK --> AD
  BL --> AD
  AD[Channel adapters<br/>authenticate · validate · normalize]
  AD --> PG[(RDS PostgreSQL<br/>inbox · orders · inventory<br/>allocations · ledger · outbox)]
  PG <-->|claim inbox / commit transaction| OW[Order API / workers<br/>NestJS on ECS Fargate<br/>bounded per channel]
  WEB -. checkout reserve .-> OW
  PG --> REL[Outbox relay]
  REL --> Q[SQS Standard<br/>ERP + 4 order-action + 4 stock queues<br/>DLQ per queue]
  Q --> EW[ERP worker]
  EW --> BC[Business Central API]
  Q --> AW[Per-channel order-action workers]
  AW --> REJ[Channel reject / cancel APIs]
  Q --> SW[Per-channel stock workers<br/>coalesce latest SKU state]
  RD[(ElastiCache Redis<br/>token buckets only)]
  SW -. rate limits .-> RD
  SW --> STOCK[Website · Nykaa<br/>Flipkart · Blinkit stock APIs]

  OPS[Ops console / retry API] --> PG
  OW --> OBS[CloudWatch metrics,<br/>logs and alarms]
  SW --> OBS
  EW --> OBS
  AW --> OBS
  Q --> OBS
